{"kind":"html","caption":"先将 k 对数组长度取模，再用三次原地反转完成右轮转：整体反转、反转前 k 项、反转剩余项。示例中 k = 3，数组依次变为 [7,6,5,4,3,2,1]、[5,6,7,4,3,2,1]、[5,6,7,1,2,3,4]。整个过程只交换元素，时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间复杂度为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>轮转数组可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.step-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.badge{min-width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}\n#title{color:#3794ff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n#detail{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px}\n.array{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.slot{text-align:center}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#2d2d2d;color:#fff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;transition:background .45s,border-color .45s}\n.cell.hot{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.index{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:8px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.swatch{width:10px;height:10px;display:inline-block;border-radius:2px;background:#0e639c;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress>div{height:100%;background:#3794ff;animation:run 12s linear infinite}\n@keyframes run{from{width:0}to{width:100%}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>三次反转，原地右轮转</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\"><span class=\"mono\">[1,2,3,4,5,6,7]</span> · k = 3 · O(n) · O(1)</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"step-line\">\n<div class=\"badge\" id=\"badge\">0</div>\n<div><div id=\"title\">初始数组</div><div id=\"detail\">最后 3 个移到开头</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"swatch\"></i>本步反转区间</span><span class=\"mono\">k % n = 3</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div></div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n  const steps = [\n    {n:'0', t:'初始数组', d:'目标：最后 3 个元素移到数组开头', a:[1,2,3,4,5,6,7], h:[]},\n    {n:'1', t:'整体反转', d:'反转 [0, 6]', a:[7,6,5,4,3,2,1], h:[0,1,2,3,4,5,6]},\n    {n:'2', t:'反转前 k 项', d:'反转 [0, 2] → 5,6,7', a:[5,6,7,4,3,2,1], h:[0,1,2]},\n    {n:'3', t:'反转剩余项', d:'反转 [3, 6] → 1,2,3,4', a:[5,6,7,1,2,3,4], h:[3,4,5,6]}\n  ];\n  const box = document.getElementById('array');\n  function draw(step) {\n    document.getElementById('badge').textContent = step.n;\n    document.getElementById('title').textContent = step.t;\n    document.getElementById('detail').textContent = step.d;\n    box.innerHTML = step.a.map((v,i) => `<div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"cell ${step.h.includes(i)?'hot':''}\">${v}</div><div class=\"index\">${i}</div></div>`).join('');\n  }\n  let current = 0;\n  draw(steps[current]);\n  setInterval(() => { current = (current + 1) % steps.length; draw(steps[current]); }, 3000);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
